{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/eeb1a4f0c43d49b0a470fbccbf8e8402/snapshots/ccfa6af043ec43cbb7112c1a2d4dd4df-00001.jpg\"/><p>位於中國華北山西省省會太原的古蹟晉祠內，兩棵500年樹齡的銀杏樹已進入一年中的最佳觀賞期，吸引眾多遊客前來欣賞金黃樹葉的美景。在祠廟建築群內，這兩棵歷史可追溯至明代（1368－1644年）的銀杏樹正披上秋色。在古建築的映襯下，它們成為深受歡迎的景觀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8505892_晉祠兩株五百年銀杏迎最佳觀賞期 - 截图4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/eeb1a4f0c43d49b0a470fbccbf8e8402/snapshots/ccfa6af043ec43cbb7112c1a2d4dd4df-00004.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>晉祠始建於西周初期（公元前1046－前771年），是為祭祀晉國開國諸侯而建的祠堂。如今，這裡保存著大量可追溯至宋代（960－1279年）的文化遺產。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.098731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:17.258377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.154666+00:00","content_hash":"a78cda0f8c50c6c87cd74285d7803f2e19c8eee8486a8866cdf52f1159999a5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.098731+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}